Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:39:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1153/1198] HERESY 1167: the Writer's runs on the 27B and on
 DeepSeek flash, and what they showed
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 05.10.2026: «подыму vLLM… и прогонишь Писателя снова по всем возможным цепочкам и вариациям»; «Возьми так же для
проб openrouter, deepseek flash». Fourteen steps (a draft, applied, reviewed, its style; a duet; a reading; the shofar; a
probed style; a child's voice; «orchestral»; a cover against a score; three one-line ideas), checked against the charter.

- The Creator's idea writer: its prompt was the Kit's own and knew nothing of the probes: it now gets the charter's
  knowledge (the findings, the instruments heard and not, the adapters, the styles, the voices).
- The idea writer said «did not return usable JSON» with the 27B: asked with the brief's JSON schema, that model on
  vLLM answers {"{"title":… (measured with and without the knowledge). A broken answer is read leniently now, and when
  that fails, the request goes once more without the schema.
- The Writer: a model that thinks before it answers spent all 8192 tokens on thinking (no draft): once, the request
  goes again with twice the room, up to 32768 (the cover adaptation then passed every check).
- The charter: a duet names each part's voice at its section's start, as his lyrics do («(Male Vocal)»); a reading's
  notes must say a real reader's adapter is needed (a 27B draft had left it out); a probed style used in a draft is
  named in the notes as not yet judged by ear.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
